  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation capabilities, separating sensing (uncontrollable events) from motion (controllable events). The specification enforces safe, efficient exploration: move_forward is only enabled when the path is clear, and rotate_clockwise is the only allowed recovery action upon any obstacle. After recovery, the robot resumes forward progress as soon as the path is clear. All uncontrollable events are handled in every state, and only one controllable is enabled per state, ensuring determinism and progress.",
